{"type":"Film","id":"FR2017_013","slug":"fr2017-013-fleur-de-tonnerre","title":{"native":"Fleur de tonnerre","english":"The Poisoning Angel"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2017-01-18","year":2017},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Stéphanie Pillonca","slug":"stephanie-pillonca","name":"Stéphanie Pillonca","birthYear":1971,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Drama","Historical film (Heritage Film)"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/96/147/168800/format_page/fleur-de-tonnerre.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i02a9b3qNhM"},"synopsis":{"native":"En 1800, la Bretagne est à genoux, accablée par le régime en place et par le clergé omnipotent. Elle se meurt dans un marasme économique qui n’en finit pas et au milieu de cela, une fillette en souffrance pousse, tant bien que mal. Cette fillette c’est « Fleur de Tonnerre », une enfant isolée, malmenée par la vie et bercée par le morbide. Elle en deviendra la plus grande « serial killer » que la terre ait jamais porté et sèmera la mort, peut être juste pour être regardée et aimée.","english":"In 1800, Brittany is on its knees, overwhelmed by the regime in place and by the omnipotent clergy. It founders in an economic slump without end in sight and, in the middle of all this, a young, suffering girl pushes back as best she can. She is known as the \"Poisoning Angel,\" an isolated child, mistreated by life and rocked by morbid thoughts. She will become one of the world's most notorious serial killers and will sow death, perhaps merely to be looked at and loved."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Belgium","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Catherine Hosmalin","slug":"catherine-hosmalin","name":"Catherine Hosmalin","birthYear":1960,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor ac